id=vollaflashdual
name=Volla Quintus Dual-Flash
version=v2.0
versionCode=2
author=blue-boy-questions
description=Binary-patches the MediaTek camera HAL (libcameracustom.flashlight.so) so cust_isDualFlashSupport returns true, making BOTH flash LEDs light natively on the Volla Quintus (algiz). Magic-mount overlay, no Xposed, no daemon. Fully reversible.
